To handle large datasets, consider streaming the data instead of loading it all into memory. This could be achieved by modifying `DecryptFile` method to read and write data in chunks rather than all at once. 

It's also recommended to add error handling code as needed for your use case. For example, you might want to add exception handling or logging so that the process can continue even if some files fail to decrypt. 

